						 <p>I'd never read this. Good god.</p> <p>I particularly like how, if the connection to the SCP is disregarded, there's nothing necessarily anomalous here. Makes the body horror that much more effective, because one doesn't have the comfort of &quot;it's only fiction&quot;.</p> 
