					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>I had a bad habit of picking at my eyelashes while working on something.</p> </blockquote> <p>Great Trichotillomania trigger you have there. Thanks. Doesn't really hurt though. Probably because I'm not picking new eyelashes like the narrator.</p> <blockquote> <p>Sometimes I ran the root end along my lower lip to feel the softness.</p> </blockquote> <p>&#8230;That's a little creepy. Not the act itself, but the fact that I do the same thing.</p> <p>&#8230;</p> <p>Okay, and the rest is disturbing as hell, and I was only able to get through it by skimming it.</p> 
				 	]]>
